flowchart LR
    U[User query] --> B{Static or dynamic?}
    B -->|Static policy / hours| C[Baseline Chatbot]
    C --> LLM[One LLM call]
    LLM --> A1[Direct answer]
    B -->|Needs live evidence| R[ReAct Agent V2]
    R --> P[LLM Thought + Action]
    P --> X[Parse Action]
    X --> T{Tool Registry}
    T --> CS[check_stock]
    T --> GD[get_discount]
    T --> SH[calc_shipping]
    CS --> O[Observation JSON]
    GD --> O
    SH --> O
    O --> R
    R -->|Enough evidence| FA[Final Answer]
    R -->|Repeated action / max steps| SF[Safe fallback]
